--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

  * The drive board firmware (source and binaries). The serial interface it
    implements is fully documented under docs/PROTOKOL.md; the implementation
    is not published.
  * Measured calibration constants for the vehicle. kalibrasyon.ornek.h carries
    the structure with values left at zero; docs/KALIBRASYON.md documents how
    each one is measured.
  * The autonomy stack and the PyQt ground-station interface, developed jointly
    with other members of the team — their work, not the author's to publish.
  * Purchasing records, supplier links and cost data.
  * Network configuration, credentials, IP addresses and Bluetooth device
    addresses, which are replaced with placeholders such as <ARAC_IP> and
    AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF.
